      <div class="loc-prose">
        <h2>Plumbing and heating in Clinton</h2>
        <p>Clinton sits about twenty minutes north of Goderich, and it is a town we serve from our Kingston Street shop. As a residential and commercial hub for northern Huron County, Clinton brings a steady mix of plumbing and heating calls, from drain backups and water heater replacements to furnace and boiler work through the winter.</p>
        <p>The housing stock in Clinton ranges from older homes with original galvanized and cast-iron waste lines to newer builds on the edges of town. That range keeps our drain-cleaning and camera equipment busy on the older side and our new-construction and renovation crews busy on the newer side, and the same licensed crew handles both.</p>
        <p>Because we are a short drive up the highway, a no-heat call or a burst pipe in Clinton gets the same fast response as one in Goderich. The 24-hour emergency line is there for the calls that cannot wait, and routine work is booked around your schedule from the shop on Kingston Street.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</LocationLayout>
